message: "If you use this software or the measurements in it, please cite the paper."
title: "Phase cost structure of LLM inference and the workload dependence of quantisation"
abstract: >-
  Measurement scripts and raw results separating prefill and decode cost in
  large language model inference across runtimes and weight precisions, and
  applying the resulting cost model to four Azure production inference traces.
